+ *
+ * <p><b>New class, not a port</b> (review pass 202warning: in the working copy of 'keystone-inventory/src/main/java/org/luckyraven/keystone/inventory/component/ItemHoldingComponent.java', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it
6-09-17, finding F8): Oriel's own {@code chest.component.ItemComponent}
+ * is actually {@code AnimatedComponent} + {@code ItemSource}/{@code LoreSource}/{@code RequirementHook} — Oriel's
+ * advanced rendering stack. This class is authored fresh at the plain shape the E6 plan calls for, with
+ * {@link ItemBuilder} overloads so the common "material + name(+lore)" call sites Gangland's
+ * {@code gangland-ui/inventory-api} used don't need to build an {@link ItemStack} by hand.
+ *
+ * <pre>{@code
+ * ItemComponent.of(Material.DIAMOND)
+ *     .name("&bBuy Diamond")
+ *     .lore("&7Click to buy", "&7Costs &e$500")
+ *     .onLeftClick(ctx -> ctx.player().performCommand("buy diamond"));
+ * }</pre>
+ */
